      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The OnPlayerTriggerExit event should trigger when the players capsule Collider exits the trigger area. \n\nBut when a player has a seat on his Avatar for other players to sit on the event will not trigger for the seated players. Even though they also leave the trigger area. \n\nVery anoying",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
